@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@tugasId = {{buatTugas.response.body.$.id}}

### 1. GET semua tugas (findAll)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tugas

### 2. POST tambah tugas (create) - 201 Created
# @name buatTugas
POST {{baseUrl}}/tugas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Laporan Praktikum Basis Data",
  "matkul": "Basis Data",
  "dosen": "BDA",
  "deadline": "2026-10-10T23:59",
  "status": "belum",
  "deskripsi": "Kumpulkan laporan praktikum modul 1-3.",
  "bobot": 15,
  "pengingat": true
}

### 3. GET satu tugas (findOne)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tugas/{{tugasId}}

### 4. PATCH ubah sebagian data (update) - hanya status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tugas/{{tugasId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "selesai" }

### 5. PATCH ubah beberapa field sekaligus
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tugas/{{tugasId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nama": "Laporan Praktikum Basis Data (Revisi)", "bobot": 25, "pengingat": false }

### 6. DELETE hapus tugas (remove) - 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tugas/{{tugasId}}

### ===================== SKENARIO ERROR =====================
### 7. Error 404 NotFoundException: id tidak ada
GET {{baseUrl}}/tugas/tidak-ada

### 8. Error 404: PATCH ke id yang sudah dihapus
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tugas/{{tugasId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "belum" }

### 9. Error 409 ConflictException: nama + mata kuliah sudah ada (data awal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tugas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Kuis 02",
  "matkul": "Perancangan dan Pemrograman Web",
  "deadline": "2026-10-20T10:00"
}

### 10. Error 400 validasi: nama terlalu pendek, deadline bukan tanggal, status/bobot salah
POST {{baseUrl}}/tugas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "ab",
  "matkul": "Basis Data",
  "deadline": "besok",
  "status": "ditunda",
  "bobot": 150
}

### 11. Error 400 validasi: properti asing ditolak (forbidNonWhitelisted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tugas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Tugas Asing",
  "matkul": "Basis Data",
  "deadline": "2026-10-20T10:00",
  "warna": "merah"
}

### 12. Error 400 validasi pada PATCH: status tidak valid
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tugas/{{tugasId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ditunda" }